---
title: NeuroSpeak System Architecture
---
graph TD
    A[📡 EEG Sensor / EDF File] --> B[MNE-Python Loader]
    B --> C[Bandpass Filter 1-40Hz]
    C --> D[Notch Filter 60Hz]
    D --> E[Average Re-reference]
    E --> F[ICA Artifact Removal]
    F --> G[Epoch Segmentation 2s]

    G --> H[Feature Extraction]
    H --> H1[PSD - Welch Method]
    H --> H2[Hjorth Parameters]
    H --> H3[Time Domain Stats]

    H1 --> I[Feature Matrix 1024-dim]
    H2 --> I
    H3 --> I

    I --> J{ML Classifier}
    J --> J1[Random Forest]
    J --> J2[SVM RBF]
    J --> J3[CNN-LSTM ★ Best]

    J1 --> K[T0/T1/T2 Labels]
    J2 --> K
    J3 --> K

    K --> L[Text Mapping Engine]
    L --> M[Generated Text]

    M --> N[Flask REST API]
    N --> O[Web Dashboard]
    N --> P[PDF Report]
    N --> Q[MongoDB Storage]

    style J3 fill:#00E5FF,color:#000
    style M  fill:#00FF9D,color:#000
    style N  fill:#7B61FF,color:#fff
